        "summary": "New shared builder src/core/peek.ts composes counts, backlog, bounded recent[] (docid/absPath), and pid-file-based serve state in one read-only pass; src/cli/commands/peek.ts exposes it as gno peek --json. Uninitialized is a success payload (initialized:false, pinned nulls, exit 0); any subquery failure is an atomic RUNTIME envelope with exit 2. The builder imports no model, embedding, or activation machinery — enforced by a test.",
